            <section class="pi-slide fade-up fade-up-5" data-slide-id="4" data-video-start="80" data-video-end="120">
                <p class="pi-label">How it's built</p>
                <h2 class="pi-h2">Spin up a vault.<br>Bring your own AI.</h2>
