                <h2 class="pi-h2">Open source builds trust.<br>Trust funds two paths.</h2>
                <p class="pi-lede">We're open-sourcing everything. More people want technology they can truly own &mdash; and that openness is what makes both revenue paths work.</p>
                <div class="pi-flywheel">
                    <div class="pi-flywheel-row">
                        <div class="pi-flywheel-role">Hosted</div>
                        <div class="pi-flywheel-body"><strong>Managed Parachute.</strong> Hosted instances of vault / agent / surface &mdash; or the whole computer. A few tiers make it easy to get started, with healthy margins. The bet: open source builds trust &rarr; more self-hosters &rarr; bigger pipe of would-be hosted customers.</div>
