                    <div class="pi-flywheel-row">
                        <div class="pi-flywheel-role">Enterprise</div>
                        <div class="pi-flywheel-body"><strong>Licenses + integration services.</strong> A company that wants to weave Parachute into a commercial product has to either share their own code back &mdash; or buy a commercial license from us. Most won't want to share, so we offer special licenses + integration services to deploy Parachute as their internal knowledge / project-management / custom-agent stack. <em>The license is the moat that funds this path.</em></div>
